  "summary": "Written by Biobot Analytics & published on February 08, 2023 by PR Newswire Cambridge, Mass. – Feb 08, 2023 – The U.S. Centers for Disease Control and Prevention (CDC) has extended its partnership with Biobot Analytics through the National Wastewater Surveillance System (NWSS) to bring COVID-19 and mpox (formerly monkeypox) wastewater analysis to communities across […]",
